  "description": "Fuaran signature-searchable pattern bank — a public, Fable-clean façade over the Fuaran.Core artifact-function registry. Deterministic, LLM-free, server-free structural retrieval of UI patterns (\"given the holes I can fill and/or the kind of node I want, which known patterns can I run?\"), plus a curated domain-neutral seed catalogue that instantiates into real Fuaran trees. Apache-2.0 licensed.",
